{"id":"caminata","lemma":"caminata","pos":"noun","rank":4459,"glosses":["walk, hike, trek"],"ipa":"/kamiˈnata/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"caminatas"},"order":4460,"examples":[{"text":"La acompañé en una caminata.","en":"I accompanied her on a walk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152105","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to accompany","l":"acompañar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Una pequeña caminata me trajo al lago.","en":"A short walk brought me to the lake.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to bring","l":"traer"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"lake"}]},{"text":"No hay nada mejor que dar una buena caminata.","en":"There's nothing better than taking a nice walk.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to give, to give out"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},null]}]}